    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d267">

                <pb facs="0448" n="352" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg352"/>

                <head>No. 267.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Nelson to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1871-11-15"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 15, 1871</date>.
                        (Received December 26.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 471.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I herewith inclose a copy of a
                    communication of this date from the Rev. Dr. Riley, respecting a forcible and
                    organized effort to destroy the freedom of religious worship at Tizayuca, in the
                    State of Hidalgo, and the prompt and efficient action of the government in the
                    premises.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>THOMAS H. NELSON.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d267-a1.xml" xpointer="d267-a1"/>
            </div>
